</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/780605c2-79de-11f1-8f02-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-07-07T075456Z-1831489698-RC2V8MAKAC5N-RTRMADP-3-SYRIA-POLITICS.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/780605c2-79de-11f1-8f02-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-07-07T075456Z-1831489698-RC2V8MAKAC5N-RTRMADP-3-SYRIA-POLITICS.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">3f02e0f2-79dd-11f1-a4fb-49f8c1159ca7</guid><pubDate>Tue, 07 Jul 2026 08:34:37 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/780605c2-79de-11f1-8f02-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-07-07T075456Z-1831489698-RC2V8MAKAC5N-RTRMADP-3-SYRIA-POLITICS.jpg">© 路透社图片</source><dc:creator>弗林</dc:creator></item><item><category>中东</category><title>马克龙到访叙利亚</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%B8%AD%E4%B8%9C/20260706-%E9%A9%AC%E5%85%8B%E9%BE%99%E5%88%B0%E8%AE%BF%E5%8F%99%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%9A</link><description>
